# ============================================================================
# 行尾与 diff 策略
#
# ⚠️ gitattributes 是「后写覆盖先写」（last match wins），不是「更具体优先」。
# 旧版本把 `* binary` 写在 `*.c text eol=lf` 那一块**之后**，而 `binary` 是
# 宏，展开为 `-diff -merge -text`，于是**所有源码都被打成了二进制**：
#   $ git diff --stat
#   device/main/accel_input.c | Bin 18079 -> 20123 bytes
# 后果：代码 diff 完全不可读、PR 无法评审、三方合并用不上文本驱动。
#
# 正确写法：**兜底规则放最前，例外放后面**。
# ============================================================================

# 兜底：让 git 自动判别文本/二进制，文本一律在工作区保持 LF
# （与仓库现状一致：32 个文本文件已经是 i/lf w/lf）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 会解析错乱
*.bat text eol=crlf

# ---- 真正的二进制资产：不规范化、不尝试文本 diff --------------------------
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.bin   binary
*.elf   binary
*.obj   binary
*.a     binary
*.lib   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.7z    binary
*.pdf   binary

# ---- 源码与文档：显式声明为文本 + 启用文本 diff ---------------------------
*.c     text diff eol=lf
*.h     text diff eol=lf
*.cpp   text diff eol=lf
*.hpp   text diff eol=lf
*.py    text diff eol=lf
*.md    text diff eol=lf
*.txt   text diff eol=lf
*.yml   text diff eol=lf
*.yaml  text diff eol=lf
*.json  text diff eol=lf
*.csv   text diff eol=lf
*.lock  text diff eol=lf
*.toml  text diff eol=lf
*.cmake text diff eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text diff eol=lf
sdkconfig.* text diff eol=lf

# ---- web assets（GitHub Pages 站点根目录 docs/）--------------------------
*.html  text diff eol=lf
*.css   text diff eol=lf
*.js    text diff eol=lf
*.svg   text diff eol=lf
.gitattributes text diff eol=lf
.gitignore     text diff eol=lf

# 必须放在最后：vendored 第三方产物不参与文本 diff（three.js + 自托管字体）
docs/vendor/** binary
